{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"group-stationary","type":"group","x":-2860,"y":-760,"width":5060,"height":560,"color":"4","label":"平稳短期动态：先判断能不能进入常规时间序列模型"},
		{"id":"group-nonstationary","type":"group","x":-1960,"y":760,"width":4160,"height":620,"color":"1","label":"非平稳长期结构：平稳性门槛失败后的另一张地图"},
		{"id":"group-chapters","type":"group","x":-2860,"y":1620,"width":5060,"height":360,"color":"6","label":"课程章节锚点：来源入口，不作为主逻辑"},
		{"id":"group-variance","type":"group","x":-1060,"y":-20,"width":1060,"height":560,"color":"2","label":"残差 / 方差扩展：均值模型之后，方差仍可能有结构"},
		{"id":"title","type":"text","text":"# Time Series Course Atlas\n\n**模型族地形图**\n\n横向读：单变量自身动态 → 外生输入/传递 → 多变量系统。\n\n纵向读：平稳短期动态 → 残差方差扩展 → 非平稳长期结构。","x":-2860,"y":-1210,"width":930,"height":300,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"legend","type":"text","text":"## Reading rule\n\n这张图不替代原笔记，只回答：**每个模型族在这门课里占什么地形位置**。\n\n每张大卡只保留三件事：\n\n- **Role**：这块负责什么\n- **Use when**：什么时候进入这块\n- **Sources**：回到哪些课程笔记和 Factase 卡片深读","x":-1760,"y":-1210,"width":1110,"height":300,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"axis-x","type":"text","text":"## Coordinate system\n\n**X-axis**\n\n单变量自身动态 → 外生输入 / 传递函数 → 多变量系统\n\n**Y-axis**\n\n平稳短期模型 ↓ 方差层 ↓ 非平稳长期关系","x":-470,"y":-1210,"width":1560,"height":300,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"foundation","type":"text","text":"## Foundation Grammar\n\n**Role**：提供全课共用语言：条件期望、白噪声、滞后算子、差分方程、根和稳定性。\n\n**Use when**：还没选模型，只是在判断“时间序列动态”该怎样被写出来。\n\n**Sources**：[[00_导论与概率论复习]] · [[02_差分方程Difference Equation]] · [[IID]] · [[Martingale Difference Sequence]] · [[White Noise]] · [[Lag Operator]] · [[Difference Equation]]","x":-2780,"y":-650,"width":560,"height":330,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"stationarity-gate","type":"text","text":"## Stationarity Gate\n\n**Role**：整门课的第一道地形边界：能否把序列当作有稳定均值、方差和自协方差结构的对象。\n\n**Use when**：任何 ARMA、ADL、VAR 或回归解释之前，都要先判断是否跨过这道门。\n\n**Sources**：[[01_介绍时间序列]] · [[Stationarity]] · [[Unit Root Test]] · [[Stationarity Tests Comparison]]","x":-1960,"y":-650,"width":560,"height":330,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"arma","type":"text","text":"## ARMA\n\n**Role**：平稳单变量序列的基准均值模型，解释当前值如何由过去值和过去冲击生成。\n\n**Use when**：只有一条主要序列，且平稳性门槛基本通过；目标是识别、估计、诊断和预测均值动态。\n\n**Sources**：[[03_平稳时间序列模型]] · [[ARMA]] · [[Autocorrelation Function]] · [[Partial Autocorrelation Function]] · [[ARMA Model Identification Steps]] · [[AIC]] · [[BIC]] · [[White Noise Test]]","x":-1060,"y":-650,"width":600,"height":330,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"adl","type":"text","text":"## ADL / Transfer Function\n\n**Role**：从“序列自身动态”走向“外生输入如何通过滞后传递到目标变量”。\n\n**Use when**：有一个外生或领先变量 z，需要解释它对 y 的当期和滞后影响，而不是只看 y 自己。\n\n**Sources**：[[05_多方程模型Multi-equation Time Series Models]] · [[ADL]] · [[Distributed Lag Model]] · [[Transfer Function Model]] · [[Cross-Correlation Function]]","x":-120,"y":-650,"width":600,"height":330,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"var","type":"text","text":"## VAR / IRF / Granger\n\n**Role**：多变量系统地形：变量之间不再只有单向输入，而是互相预测、互相响应。\n\n**Use when**：多个变量都可能是内生的，需要看冲击路径、预测方向和预测误差来源。\n\n**Sources**：[[VAR Model]] · [[Impulse Response Function]] · [[Granger Causality Test]] · [[Variance Decomposition]]","x":820,"y":-650,"width":600,"height":330,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"garch","type":"text","text":"## ARCH / GARCH\n\n**Role**：ARMA 之后的方差层。均值残差可以已经近似白噪声，但残差平方仍然可能有可建模结构。\n\n**Use when**：出现波动聚集、条件异方差，或 ARCH-LM / McLeod-Li 对残差平方给出信号。\n\n**Sources**：[[04_波动建模 Modeling Volatility]] · [[Conditional Heteroskedasticity]] · [[Volatility Clustering]] · [[ARCH LM Test]] · [[McLeod-Li Test]] · [[ARCH]] · [[GARCH]]","x":-980,"y":90,"width":840,"height":330,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"trend-unitroot","type":"text","text":"## Trend / Unit Root / ARIMA\n\n**Role**：非平稳单变量地形：先区分确定性趋势和随机趋势，再决定去趋势、差分或 ARIMA。\n\n**Use when**：Stationarity Gate 失败，但主要仍是一条序列自身的动态问题。\n\n**Sources**：[[06_含趋势的模型]] · [[Unit Root Test]] · [[Augmented Dickey-Fuller Test]] · [[KPSS Test]] · [[First Difference]] · [[ARIMA]]","x":-1880,"y":890,"width":740,"height":360,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"cointegration","type":"text","text":"## Cointegration / ECM / Johansen\n\n**Role**：非平稳多变量地形：多个变量各自漂移，但长期关系可能约束它们共同运动。\n\n**Use when**：多个 I(1) 变量有经济含义上的长期关系；直接回归有伪回归风险，但差分又可能丢掉长期信息。\n\n**Sources**：[[07_协整和误差修正模型]] · [[Spurious Regression]] · [[Cointegration]] · [[Common Stochastic Trend]] · [[Error Correction Model]] · [[Engle-Granger Two-Step Test]] · [[Johansen Cointegration Test]]","x":420,"y":890,"width":820,"height":360,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"chapter-00-02","type":"text","text":"## 00-02 Foundation\n\n[[00_导论与概率论复习]] · [[01_介绍时间序列]] · [[02_差分方程Difference Equation]]\n\n任务：准备语言和稳定性直觉。","x":-2780,"y":1720,"width":650,"height":180,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"chapter-03","type":"text","text":"## 03 ARMA\n\n[[03_平稳时间序列模型]]\n\n任务：平稳单变量建模、诊断和预测。","x":-1940,"y":1720,"width":560,"height":180,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"chapter-04","type":"text","text":"## 04 Volatility\n\n[[04_波动建模 Modeling Volatility]]\n\n任务：在均值模型后处理条件方差。","x":-1200,"y":1720,"width":560,"height":180,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"chapter-05","type":"text","text":"## 05 Multi-equation\n\n[[05_多方程模型Multi-equation Time Series Models]]\n\n任务：外生输入、VAR、冲击传导。","x":-460,"y":1720,"width":560,"height":180,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"chapter-06-07","type":"text","text":"## 06-07 Nonstationary\n\n[[06_含趋势的模型]] · [[07_协整和误差修正模型]]\n\n任务：单位根、趋势、协整、ECM。","x":280,"y":1720,"width":760,"height":180,"color":"1"}
	],
